# INVWINOB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the location
# tree.  Each location is listed under the one it is inside, indented,
# with its type's name; a letter selects the next location whose name
# starts with it, going round past the last.  Move shows the pick list
# "Move <name> into" on the location's container, its first row (top
# level) for Office: Shelf A1, inside Office, is refused in a message
# box, the list staying; Box B2 moved to the top level, then into Office,
# the tree fetched again from its start each time, the location moved
# selected and its note on the status bar.  DEL on Office, which holds
# items and locations, is refused, the tree unchanged.  In the location
# form, the type's name beside its code, F4 on Type lists the location
# types; Inside shows its path below it, F4 there lists the tree on its
# value, which refuses Box B2 itself, and whose first row, (top level),
# empties it; a code typed that names no location is said under the
# fields as the field is left, as is B2's own, which OK then refuses
# again, and one that names another shows its path; a type typed shows
# its name once the field is left, and PgDn goes to the last field of the
# Record page, past that name; ESC asks before the changes are dropped.
# ENTER on Office, which holds locations, shows the items of every
# location below it too, each named in the Location column, and
# Everything below its own alone, the frame's title saying what is shown,
# and the Record menu then leaving Everything below unchecked; ESC goes
# back to the tree, Office selected; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINOB.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B
S TREE
# letters: S, B, then O again from the last row
T S
S LETTERS
T B
T O
S ROUND
# Office into Shelf A1, inside it: refused
K ALT-C M
S MOVETO
K DOWN DOWN ENTER
S REFUSED
K ENTER
S STAYED
K ESC
# Box B2 to the top level, then into Office
K END ALT-C M
S ONPARENT
K HOME ENTER
S TOTOP
K ALT-C M DOWN DOWN ENTER
S INOFFICE
# Office holds items and locations: refused
K HOME DEL Y
S HOLDS
K ENTER
S HELD
# the form of Box B2: Type's list, Inside's path and list
K DOWN CTRL-E
S FORM
K ALT-T F4
S TYPES
K ESC ALT-I
S INSIDE
K F4
S PICK
K DOWN ENTER
S SELFPICK
K ENTER HOME ENTER
S TOP
T ZZ
K TAB
S NOSUCH
K ALT-I
T B2
K TAB
S SELFTYPE
K ENTER
S SELFOK
K ALT-I
T A1
K TAB
S WHERE
# a type typed shows its name as the field is left; PgDn goes to the
# last field of the Record page, past that name
K ALT-T
T SHELF
K TAB
S TYPENAME
K PGDN
S PGDN
K ESC
S DISCARD
K Y
S KEPT
# Office's contents: everything below it, as it holds locations, then
# its own items
K HOME ENTER
S BELOW
K ALT-C G
S HERE
K ALT-C
S RECMENU
K ESC ESC ESC
S BACK
K ALT-F X
